OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CToday:FOnce any mist or fog clears,    
OL,6,Fanother mainly dry day with variable   
OL,7,Fcloud and some bright or sunny spells. 
OL,8,FChance of some coastal showers.        
OL,9,FRemaining rather cold with generally   
OL,10,Flight winds.                           
OL,12,CTonight:                               
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloudy with a band of rain    
OL,15,Fmoving eastwards across the region,    
OL,16,Fthis could fall as freezing rain       
OL,17,Fbefore turning to snow over high       
OL,18,Fground. Winds will become increasingly 
OL,19,Fbreezy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
